    "## 5. Conclusions\n",
    "\n",
    "- On the real, research-grade HARTH dataset, with a scientifically honest subject-wise\n",
    "  train/test split, **XGBoost was the best-performing model** for this activity recognition\n",
    "  task — beating both LightGBM and two deep learning architectures (1D CNN, LSTM) on macro F1.\n",
